# ============================================================
# .gitignore for the dissertation research repo
# ============================================================

# --- Kept out of the public GitHub repo (by request) ---
CLAUDE.md
docs/
Dissertation.ipynb

# --- Model weights, checkpoints, packed data: never commit ---
# Project rule (CLAUDE.md): no data or model weights in the repo; they live on
# the server. This catches Results/**/vae_*.pt etc. The small figures, logs and
# metrics JSON under Results/ are still committed.
*.pt
*.pth
*.ckpt
*.safetensors
*.npz
*.npy
*.h5
*.hdf5
*.memmap

# --- Python ---
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.venv/
venv/
env/

# --- OS / editor cruft ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*~

# --- Secrets ---
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
